  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/nickkapur.bsky.social\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Nick Kapur</a> 的《<a href=\"https://www.hup.harvard.edu/books/9780674984424\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Japan at the Crossroads: Conflict and Compromise after Anpo</a>》出了日文版《<a href=\"https://www.msz.co.jp/book/detail/09879/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">アフター安保1960<br>\n戦後日本の岐路をさぐる</a>》（（果然是）みすず書房）。<a href=\"https://www.williamandrewswriter.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">William Andrews</a> 的足立正生傳記《<a href=\"http://awaimedia.com/WilliamAndrewsBook.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Pink Auteur, Red Outlaw: Adachi Masao and Japan’s Cinema of Revolution</a>》終於由 awai books 出版。</p>\n<p>也推薦 Kapur 的<a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/nickkapur.bsky.social\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">天竺帳號</a>。</p>",
